**Drown the Streets** [three-actions] (**primal**, **water**) The Deluge Tempest floods its current settlement sector until the beginning of its next turn. The ground is difficult terrain, and non-flying creatures in the sector treat it as uneven ground. This ability affects the battlefield but does not itself add a settlement damage hit.

